	*G*♭⁎ | b | b | a | a | (*B₁*♭)
	*D*♭⁎ | b | b | b | a | (*F₁*)
	*A*♭⁎ | b | b | b | b | (*C₁*)
	*E*♭⁎ | a | b | b | b | (*G₁*)
	*B*♭⁎ | a | a | b | b | (*D₁*)
	*F* | a | a | a | b | *A₁*
