 a | a | *E₁*
	*G* | b | a | a | a | *B₁* ⁎ or *C*♭
	*D* | b | b | a | a | *F₁*♯ ⁎ or *G*♭
	*A* | b | b | b | a | *C₁*♯ ⁎ or *D*♭
	*E* | b | b | b | b | *G₁*♯ ⁎ or *A*♭
